    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272212</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ん？
なんか気配が……
いや、気のせいだな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh? There's a weird
vibe around... Nah, I
must be imagining it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272300</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おおーい、そこの君ー
君だよ君、待ってくれたまえ！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Heeeeey, you theeeere!
You! Yes, you! Come heeere!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272348</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え？　え？？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh? Ehh?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272420</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……ひょっとして、
井戸の中からかな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Maybe it's coming
from the well?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272484</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おおーい！
誰かいるのかー？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Heeey! Is there
anyone in heere?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272648</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おおっ！　そうだよそうだよ
やっと気づいてもらえたか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh! Yes, that's right!
Finally, someone noticed!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272648</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……ほう、いい面構えだ。
久しぶりにピーンときた！
君ならばやってくれそうだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Oh, what's this? I like the cut of your
jib. Even just looking at you, I get the
feeling you'll be able to sort this for me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272712</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……中が真っ暗で何も見えねー</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...It's way too dark in there.
I can't see a damn thing.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272816</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、人がいるみたい
……何も見えないけど。
黒い服とか着てるのかな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, it looks like there's someone in
there. ...Even if we can't see them.
Maybe they're wearing black clothes?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272932</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おーい！　なんだアンタ！？
はまってんのかー？　待ってろ
すぐ引き上げてやるからなー</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Heeey! So what's your deal?
You stuck down theeere? Just wait
a sec, we'll get you pulled up sooon!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273052</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いや、ちょっと違うんだ。
なんだかここは違う世界のようで
帰る手段を探しているんだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's not the problem, exactly. I think
this is a different world from where I'm
from. I'm looking for a way back.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273096</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>違う世界？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A different world?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273324</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>んだ。次元やら空間やらを超えた、
別の世界が無数にあるらしいだ。
そのどっか１箇所だよ。たぶんな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Alrighty, so if ya cross dimensions and
space, you'll find countless other worlds.
He must be from one of them.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273324</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おめぇらが使ってる時空転移と
腹違いの弟の親戚みたいなもんだ。
あ～、やっぱり、おらは博識だよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's a little like the half-brother of the time
travel ya two are always doing. Ahh, I
could be a real professor, couldn't I?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273540</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうそう、それだよ君。
なんか変なオーロラに入ったら
ここに飛ばされてしまったんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Right, it's just like he said. I
ended up inside a strange aurora
and somehow got sent here.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273540</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうだろう？
なんとかならないかね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What do you think?
Anything you can do?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273540</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もしくは、そういう何とか転移に
詳しい人を呼んでもらえないかね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Or, maybe you could call for
someone who knows more
about that whatever-it-was-travel?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273588</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……と、くれば</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...In that case, I guess...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273632</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うん、だね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273844</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そんな&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;に見つめられると
照れてしかたないだ～よ∀
おら、頼られてるだなや～∀∀∀</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ahh, I just can't help gettin' all
shy when &lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt; looks at me
like that~! I'm just feelin' so shy~!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273844</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だども、裏切るようだが、
おらはあんな黒いおっさんと
らんでぶーなどまっぴらだっぺ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, sorry to get your hopes up. I wouldn't
go down there and meet that old man in
black even for the whole world.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273888</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ちげーよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Who asked you!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273960</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あの、ちょっとだけ
待っててください</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Um, please wait
just a bit longer!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274056</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おお！ありがとう。待ってるから
あわてずに行ってくれたまえ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Okay! Thanks. I'll be waiting. Just
get back to me when you can.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
